{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1048.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"aafbcd35a56a787b23a93950cf7c703222707c7bc75e839a4d97fa9c47977a3f","ja":"深夜のスイーツ","zh":"深夜的甜点","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1048.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"b23e098b0c132211796d35818c6b978fd3606929c60486c91a1c5428c692cda0","ja":"とりあえず、お茶を淹れてきました。","zh":"先泡了茶过来。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1048.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"c1555a980c59495b6d672ba6bca16f031b9e57f0584446087f5259a4592caa0d","ja":"ありがとう、いただくわね……ふう。","zh":"谢谢，那我收下了……呼。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1048.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"5a85de1fe92f9ad9aeabdf852130eb2e55b78ae14ec9d04efc932858f0ae5e9e","ja":"ねぇねぇ、さっきあずさが言ってた\n「カロリーを取り戻しちゃう」ってどういうこと？","zh":"我说我说，刚才梓说的\n“把卡路里补回来”到底是什么意思啊？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1048.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"5313f2631f7feb79e90633ba92fab3e172dadf8e3db41dd44b6074919c540826","ja":"実は……昨日の深夜に、チョコプリンを3つも\n食べてしまったの。どうしても我慢できなくって……。","zh":"其实……昨天深夜，我实在没忍住……\n吃了整整3个巧克力布丁。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1048.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"9ee5f846ff20a4ba44d8ef2f28c0cdb83703c41c03ba4d045b81876a9a989a51","ja":"そうしたら案の定、ボディラインに影響が出て……！\nだからしばらく、スイーツは控えないと……。","zh":"结果果不其然，身材走样了……！\n所以暂时得忍着不能吃甜点了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1048.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"e62690257f20c847b0ff45b08b24ba14ce5cf4595b200aa1bdc488d116ef4069","ja":"そ、そんなにすぐは反映されない気もしますが……。\n熱の入ったレッスンはそういう理由だったんですね。","zh":"总、总觉得应该没那么快见效才对……\n原来之前的全情投入排练是因为这个原因啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1048.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"d1dbb5f8a0657284c307c017e061c6bf6c72932de97dfe81419afd85ab523604","ja":"ええ。食べてしまったものは仕方ないから、\nレッスンでカロリーを消費しようとしていたの。","zh":"是啊。既然已经吃下去了也没办法，\n所以我本来正打算靠练习来消耗卡路里呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1048.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"39627d551a878415aa750b075c63f193db20f9dcd41cff731374de400237b8a6","ja":"でも運動の消費カロリーって、意外と少ないわよね。\nもっと体を動かさないと……。","zh":"不过运动消耗的卡路里，比想象中要少呢。\n得更加多活动活动身体才行……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1048.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"b24e143f3e4b258a5ab280f5d403ea5f4aa9d8eb28e21e8108f4463889c4d234","ja":"そうなの！？　あんなにがんばってたのに……。\nカロリーって大変なんだね！","zh":"是这样吗！？明明那么努力了……。\n卡路里还真是不容易对付呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1048.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"dc1f78217e04d484536a093f79eea2396bc2961f9e153c10cbf1cb75876c859a","ja":"そうなの。だから深夜のスイーツは特に、\n我慢しなきゃいけないんだけど……。","zh":"是这样啊。所以特别是深夜的甜点，\n更得忍住不能吃才行……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1048.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"a3b4630563d8590a4ac1e748ec2a00bb909c312e8d54af5356435432533424cc","ja":"お湯を飲んで空腹をまぎらわす、\nという方法を聞いたことがあります。","zh":"听说过一种通过喝热水\n来缓解空腹感的方法。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1048.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"0388869d41e65619277f6cac1225cd5ce4c317c562fd80029b1115c7df96e39e","ja":"少し気がまぎれる程度かもしれませんが……。","zh":"虽然可能只是稍微缓解一下心情……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1048.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"5b3fe54a7973fda672ef87bd3cb9ee1f06e61169df49f1587bafddb57c5c0863","ja":"お湯だけじゃお腹いっぱいにならないぞ……。","zh":"光喝热水可填不饱肚子啊……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1048.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"5b75f41b485032357b16abb7354aebe82e8160facfff54dbd6d157fe8f893df8","ja":"そうよね～……。はぁ～、深夜に食べても平気な\nスイーツがどこかにあればいいんだけど……。","zh":"就是说嘛～……。唉～，要是哪里有就算半夜吃\n也没关系的甜品就好了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
